<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov zinc exports rise 29.8 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov zinc exports rise 29.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys rose to 197,258 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, up 29.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Unwrought zinc and zinc alloy exports were 21,205 tonnes in November alone.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 151,910 tonnes of zinc in the first 11 months of 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
</text>
